@nicolas-grekas Makes sense, thanks for the update!

My motivation behind `#[MapRateLimit]` was that `RateLimit` could be used to provide feedback to the user (e.g., `You have 5 messages left`), so I wanted a way to avoid using global/class-level limiters or to only operate on explicitly exposed ones.

But as u said, this can always be added later if needed.

